This is what allows EV, grid, components, skills, mining and repair to live
in the same system.
7. R2 lakehouse layout

pow-lake/

observations/
events/
entities/
identifiers/
edges/

grid_projects/
grid_nodes/
evse_state/
component_offers/
vehicle_faults/
repair_attempts/
