tariffs/
compute_state/

Store normalized data as Parquet.

Use Iceberg/R2 Data Catalog or similar as the query/index layer where
useful, but keep raw R2 objects + Parquet canonical and rebuildable.
8. Runtime split

Cloudflare handles:

   - scheduling
   - lightweight API collection
   - queues
   - control state
   - raw storage
   - simple normalization
   - public API/MCP

VPS handles:

   - DuckDB
   - Polars
   - PyArrow
   - PyIceberg
   - large bulk imports
   - fuzzy identity resolution
   - geospatial joins
   - Parquet compaction
   - marketplace/browser collection
   - large transformations
   - backtests

Avoid forcing heavy data work into Workers.
